  "monthlyDeMinimis": {
    "monthlyWithholdingFloor": 1,
    "$comment": "FYI-104, quoted directly: 'No withholding is required if the total withholding for an employee during any one month is less than one dollar.' A MONTHLY test, so it needs a monthly running figure — certificate.stateTaxWithheldThisMonth — which the caller keeps, exactly as Denver's monthly head tax already requires. With nothing supplied the test runs on this cheque alone, which is right for a monthly payroll and conservative everywhere else: it can only ever zero an amount already under a dollar.",
    "source": {
      "title": "New Mexico Taxation and Revenue Department — FYI-104, New Mexico Withholding Tax",
