  "$yearNote": "2025 ruleset: FYI-104 (Rev. 11/2024) percentage tables for wages paid on or after 1 January 2025: 1.5% to 5.9% in ten bands per period for single, married and head of household, parsed from the published tables. Supplemental 5.9%. The workers' compensation fee was $2.00 employee / $2.30 employer a quarter until 2025-06-30 and $2.25 / $2.55 from 2025-07-01 (effectiveDated)."
